# API Reference — Petstore 2.0

## GET /pets

**List all pets**
| Parameter | In |
|-----------|-----|
| limit | query |

## POST /pets

**Create a pet**
| Parameter | In |
|-----------|-----|
| body | body |

## GET /pets/{id}

**Get a pet by ID**
| Parameter | In |
|-----------|-----|
| id | path |

## DELETE /pets/{id}

**Delete a pet**
| Parameter | In |
|-----------|-----|
| id | path |

## GET /store/inventory

**Get store inventory**

